      "note": "counts over the 24 hours of cases the rules do not cover or that broke them: unlinked position events, opening splits off the event, insurance share off the ceil rule, accAmount off the 80 % rule, bankrupt (X <= 0) or partial liquidations, liquidation fills with a fee, logs with an unknown topic"
    }
  }
}
